!%DEBUG-I-VERIFYICF, entering command procedure DUN72B.DBG
! ! DUN72B.DBG - Phase 72's debugger session on DUNGEON.EXE, round 2
! ! (README.md): round 1's EXAMINEs, whose %X prefixes VMS's debugger
! ! refused. The radix is set to hexadecimal first (FORTRAN's default is
! ! decimal), so every address here is hex, and each starts with a digit.
! !
! SET RADIX HEXADECIMAL
! SHOW RADIX
!input radix : hexadecimal
!output radix: hexadecimal
! EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
!DUNGEO+2:       MOVAL    L^00002DC8,R11
! EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION
!DUNGEO\%LINE 218:       CALLG    (R11),L^0000CDD0
